[38;5;243m──────[38;5;243m───[38;5;243m──[38;5;243m──[38;5;243m─[38;5;243m─[38;5;244m──[38;5;244m─[38;5;244m─[38;5;244m─[38;5;244m─[38;5;244m─[38;5;244m─[38;5;102m─[38;5;102m─[38;5;102m─[38;5;245m─[38;5;245m─[38;5;245m─[38;5;245m─[38;5;246m─[38;5;246m─[38;5;246m─[38;5;246m─[38;5;247m─[38;5;247m─[38;5;247m─[38;5;247m─[38;5;247m─[38;5;248m─[38;5;248m─[38;5;248m─[38;5;145m─[38;5;145m─[38;5;249m─[38;5;249m─[38;5;250m─[38;5;250m─[38;5;250m─[38;5;251m─[38;5;251m─[38;5;251m─[38;5;252m─[38;5;252m─[0;1;38;5;231;49m◢[38;5;98m◣[0;38;5;97;49m━[38;5;61m━[38;5;61m━[38;5;32m━[38;5;31m━[38;5;31m━[38;5;31m━[38;5;30m━[38;5;30m━[38;5;30m━[38;5;29m━[38;5;29m━[38;5;29m━[38;5;65m━[38;5;64m━[38;5;100m━[38;5;94m━[38;5;94m━[38;5;94m━[38;5;130m━[38;5;131m━[38;5;131m━[38;5;131m━[38;5;95m━[0m

  This is Prism's terminal site: 435 animated and static terminal facets —
  scenes, spinners, progress meters, charts, text art, TUI controls, diagrams
  and ops views — in 17 galleries, drawn by prism-term 0.2.0, a zero-dependency
  Node engine.

[0;1;38;5;98;49mBROWSE WITH CURL[0;39;49m [38;5;243m────────────────────────────────[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/tty          [0;2;39;49mthe terminal site's home[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/t/<gallery>  [0;2;39;49mone gallery, by category[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/f/<facet>    [0;2;39;49mone facet: still and commands[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/t/all        [0;2;39;49mevery facet on one line each[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/t/themes     [0;2;39;49mcolor schemes for your terminal[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/t/help       [0;2;39;49mthis page[0m

  Pages are stills that fit 80 columns. Long pages: pipe to less -R. Every page
  also comes as:
  [38;5;31m<page>.txt  [0;2;39;49mplain ASCII, no escape codes — for grep, NO_COLOR, screen readers[0m
  [38;5;31m<page>.24   [0;2;39;49mtruecolor instead of the default 256 colors[0m
  [0;2;39;49mSearch:   [0;38;5;31;49mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/t/all.txt | grep -i spinner[0m
  [0;2;39;49mPaging:   [0;38;5;31;49mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/t/ops | less -R[0m
  [0;2;39;49mWindows PowerShell 5: type [0;38;5;31;49mcurl.exe[0;2;39;49m (plain "curl" is an alias there).[0m
  [0;2;39;49mPowerShell and cmd don't continue lines with \: join a command that ends[0m
  [0;2;39;49min \ with the next line (drop the \) before you run it.[0m

[0;1;38;5;98;49mTHE LIVE PLAYER[0;39;49m [38;5;243m─────────────────────────────────[0m
  The live player renders facets in real time and detects your terminal
  (truecolor, 256, 16, mono; braille and block glyphs, or plain ASCII; Prism
  Night or Prism Day for dark and light backgrounds). It needs Node 18+ and no
  network after the download.
[38;5;31m  npx -y --package=https://prism.jeremyfhall.com/dl/prism-term-0.2.0.tgz \[0m
[38;5;31m    prism-term[0m
[0;2;39;49m  …then add a command:[0m
    [38;5;31m(none)            [0;2;39;49mbrowse the catalog: arrows move, / searches, Enter plays[0m
    [38;5;31mplay <facet>      [0;2;39;49mone facet fullscreen (--size 80x24, --depth 256, --ascii)[0m
    [38;5;31mlist              [0;2;39;49mevery facet, grouped by gallery[0m
    [38;5;31msnapshot <facet>  [0;2;39;49mprint one still frame to stdout[0m
    [38;5;31mtheme <format>    [0;2;39;49mPrism Night / Day colors for your terminal emulator[0m
[0;2;39;49m  Day or Night: --day, --night, or PRISM_TERM_THEME=day|night; --no-intro skips[0m
[0;2;39;49m  the opening beam, and NO_COLOR / PRISM_REDUCED_MOTION=1 are honored.[0m
[0;2;39;49m  Prefer a permanent install? Run this once, then just type prism-term:[0m
  [38;5;31mnpm i -g https://prism.jeremyfhall.com/dl/prism-term-0.2.0.tgz[0m
[0;2;39;49m  /dl/prism-term.tgz is an alias for the newest release. To pin one and verify[0m
[0;2;39;49m  it, download it and check it against SHA256SUMS first:[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sLO https://prism.jeremyfhall.com/dl/prism-term-0.2.0.tgz[0m
  [38;5;31mcurl -sL prism.jeremyfhall.com/dl/SHA256SUMS | sha256sum -c --ignore-missing[0m
  [38;5;31mnpx -y --package=./prism-term-0.2.0.tgz prism-term[0m

